  "qualificationScope": "Mac signed F2 built G1=G2=G3 from the current 18-module core, with byte-identical container and native code. Changes seed/00-ns, seed/21-check, seed/30-lower and seed/90-drv (JUN-733 slice 1): a keyword map literal is the one declared record of its shape, or the record its slot expects (structural identity); nil at a keyword key is the none of an [:option T] field and a value T there its some; new code E2182 (nil with no T). Programs without these forms are unchanged. Native ARM packed/core, native x86, controller, public aliases, cold C0, performance, release and physical qualification remain separate.",
